EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Do you think fish talk to each other
in the water?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}} 'Cause that would be
so awesome! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}¿Tú crees que los peces hablan
entre ellos en el agua?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}} ¡Porque
entonces me caerían mucho mejor!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Tu crois qu'les poissons taillent le
bout d'gras dans l'eau ?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}J'aimerais
trop écouter ça !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Secondo te i pesci parlano?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}} Non
sarebbe male imparare la loro
lingua, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Sence balıklar suyun altında birbirleriyle
konuşuyor mudur?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}} Çünkü bu acayip
havalı olurdu! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
